OL,3,CDisabled bus pass holders to get free
OL,4,Ctravel at all times, government
OL,5,Cannounces
OL,7,FPeople who have a disabled bus pass
OL,8,Fwill be able to travel at all hours
OL,9,Ffor free from April next year, the
OL,10,Fgovernment has announced.
OL,12,FCurrently, disabled bus passes are
OL,13,Fonly valid for travel on weekdays from
OL,14,F9.30am until 11pm, except in local
OL,15,Fauthorities which funded an extension.
OL,16,FGreater Manchester did this when Andy
OL,17,FBurnham was Mayor.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
