CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1787042885
OL,3,CDisabled bus pass holders to get free
OL,4,Ctravel at all times, government
OL,5,Cannounces
OL,7,FHowever new funding from the
OL,8,Fgovernment will see time restrictions
OL,9,Fremoved in an effort to relieve cost
OL,10,Fof living pressures.
OL,12,FIn total, #60 million will be given in
OL,13,Ffunding - #40 million will come from
OL,14,Fthe Department for Work and Pensions
OL,15,Fand #20 million from the Department
OL,16,Ffor Transport.
OL,18,FThis is the latest in a series of
OL,19,Fpolicies from the new prime minister
OL,20,Fwhich aim to tackle living costs.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
