OL,3,CDisabled bus pass holders to get free
OL,4,Ctravel at all times, government
OL,5,Cannounces
OL,7,FIn the first few weeks of his
OL,8,Fpremiership, Burnham has cut business
OL,9,Frates for pubs, capped bus fares at #2
OL,10,Fand axed VAT from electricity bills.
OL,12,FBurnham said: "Buses are a lifeline
OL,13,Ffor so many people ` making it easier
OL,14,Fto get to work, education and
OL,15,Fhealthcare.
OL,26,@tD@OOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
