OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1787042885
OL,3,CDisabled bus pass holders to get free
OL,4,Ctravel at all times, government
OL,5,Cannounces
OL,7,F"It's simply not right that many
OL,8,Fdisabled people cannot travel using
OL,9,Ftheir pass during certain times of the
OL,10,Fday. So we're fixing that. Disabled
OL,11,Fpeople will now have unlimited free
OL,12,Fbus travel 24/7.
OL,14,F"I did it before in Greater Manchester
OL,15,Fand I'm proud to do it now for the
OL,16,Fwhole country. This is part of our
OL,17,Fongoing action to bring back hope and
OL,18,Fgive people some much-needed breathing
OL,19,Fspace on the cost of living," he added.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOU{D@]O]
