OL,3,CDisabled bus pass holders to get free
OL,4,Ctravel at all times, government
OL,5,Cannounces
OL,7,FLiberal Democrat Tom Gordon has been
OL,8,Fcampaigning for the change for almost
OL,9,Ftwo years.
OL,11,FHe welcomed the move, calling it a
OL,12,F"huge win for the disabled community."
OL,14,F"Disabilities don't start at 9
OL,15,Fo'clock, neither should disabled bus
OL,16,Fpasses and soon enough they won't,"
OL,17,Fthe MP for Harrogate and Knaresborough
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,26,@tD@fO]vD@AOU
